{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible then move towards object, if object approached then take object and finally process object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    />\"",
